{
  "total_duration": 611.652,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.76,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果一个人走进危险区域，却完全不知道自己危险，你会替他紧张吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 6.11,
      "end": 11.79,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这课里，一个醉汉突然走进斗牛场中央，观众都开始喊。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 12.14,
      "end": 15.7,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "他却以为自己很镇定，甚至还向观众鞠躬。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 16.05,
      "end": 21.65,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "更好笑的是，作者把公牛写得像一个会生气、会同情的人。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 30.335,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天我们学的不只是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "red for danger"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，而是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "danger, luck, and comic writing"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 30.685,
      "end": 32.965,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看危险场景。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 33.315,
      "end": 40.955,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：斗牛正在进行，一个醉汉突然走进场地中央，完全没有意识到危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 41.305,
      "end": 46.925,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "During a bullfight, a drunk suddenly wandered into the middle of the ring"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 47.275,
      "end": 54.818,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "ring"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是戒指，而是圆形表演场地，比如 bullring 或 boxing ring。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 55.168,
      "end": 60.592,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "人群开始喊，因为"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the drunk was unaware of the danger"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 60.942,
      "end": 67.798,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "During a bullfight, wandered into the middle of the ring, unaware of the danger"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 68.148,
      "end": 71.468,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，红帽让危险转向他。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 71.818,
      "end": 79.738,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：公牛看见醉汉挥着红帽、说粗鲁的话，注意力从斗牛士转向了他。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 80.088,
      "end": 84.292,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The bull was busy with the matador at the time"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 84.642,
      "end": 88.529,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是它突然"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "caught sight of the drunk"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 88.879,
      "end": 94.015,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个醉汉正在"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "shouting rude remarks and waving a red cap"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 94.365,
      "end": 103.645,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "注意，红色在这里像 danger signal，但真正让场面危险的是动作、挑衅和他闯进了不该进的区域。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 103.995,
      "end": 106.955,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，危险真的冲过来了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 107.305,
      "end": 113.105,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：公牛像被冒犯了一样，忘了斗牛士，朝醉汉冲过去。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 113.455,
      "end": 118.671,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文最幽默的一句是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Apparently sensitive to criticism"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 119.02,
      "end": 124.74,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "公牛当然不是真的懂批评；作者是在把它写得像一个有脾气的人。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 125.09,
      "end": 131.25,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后危险动作来了："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the bull forgot all about the matador and charged at the drunk"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 131.6,
      "end": 135.8,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "人群突然安静，因为这不是表演效果，而是真的危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 136.15,
      "end": 139.91,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，幸运逃开，却被误会成勇敢。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 140.26,
      "end": 146.54,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：公牛靠近时，醉汉笨拙地往旁边一闪，侥幸躲开。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 146.89,
      "end": 152.846,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "When the bull got close to him, he clumsily stepped aside to let it pass"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 153.196,
      "end": 159.283,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "人群欢呼，他还"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "bowed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，好像自己完成了精彩表演。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 159.633,
      "end": 166.625,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但真正正确的动作是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "three men had come into the ring and they quickly dragged the drunk to safety"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 166.975,
      "end": 172.495,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后作者继续拟人："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Even the bull seemed to feel sorry for him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 172.845,
      "end": 178.076,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，斗牛到底是什么？这课是在夸斗牛吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 178.426,
      "end": 191.426,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是。这里我们只需要理解场景：一个圆形场地，一头强壮的公牛，一个 trained performer，也就是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "matador"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，还有观看的人群。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 191.775,
      "end": 193.99,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那它为什么危险？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 194.34,
      "end": 204.94,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为这是人和强大动物在开放场地里的表演。现代很多人也批评 bullfighting，因为动物会受到伤害，所以我们不把它当成值得模仿的事情。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 205.29,
      "end": 211.315,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "标题叫"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Red for danger"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，是不是公牛真的讨厌红色？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 211.665,
      "end": 222.825,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "温柔纠正一下：red cap 在故事里很醒目，像危险信号；但更关键的是 movement 和 provocation，也就是挥动和挑衅。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 223.174,
      "end": 226.579,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以红色是故事符号，不是唯一原因？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 226.928,
      "end": 233.888,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly. The red cap helps us remember danger, but the drunk's behaviour makes the danger concrete."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 234.238,
      "end": 237.825,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "为什么醉汉在危险里还显得好笑？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 238.175,
      "end": 247.914,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为他"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "was unaware of the danger"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，又"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "seemed quite sure of himself"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。他不是勇敢，是不知道自己不知道。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 248.264,
      "end": 252.63,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "作者为什么说公牛"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "sensitive to criticism"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 252.98,
      "end": 261.32,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这是 personification，拟人。作者把公牛写得像一个听懂粗鲁评论、被冒犯、后来还同情醉汉的人。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 261.67,
      "end": 264.531,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "公牛真的会同情他吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 264.881,
      "end": 271.761,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文不是科学报告，是喜剧写法。危险是真的，幽默来自 writer's voice。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 272.111,
      "end": 275.566,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那我们今天要学的安全提醒是什么？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 275.916,
      "end": 284.996,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "看见边界就停下来。体育场、舞台、动物围栏、机器人演示区，都不要等人群大喊了才意识到危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 285.346,
      "end": 289.93,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "During a bullfight, a drunk suddenly wandered into the middle of the ring."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 290.28,
      "end": 294.72,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The crowd began to shout, but the drunk was unaware of the danger."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 295.07,
      "end": 302.558,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The bull was busy with the matador at the time, but it suddenly caught sight of the drunk who was shouting rude remarks and waving a red cap."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 302.908,
      "end": 309.148,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Apparently sensitive to criticism, the bull forgot all about the matador and charged at the drunk."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 309.498,
      "end": 312.186,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The crowd suddenly grew quiet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 312.536,
      "end": 316.352,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The drunk, however, seemed quite sure of himself."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 316.702,
      "end": 321.478,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "When the bull got close to him, he clumsily stepped aside to let it pass."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 321.827,
      "end": 325.139,
      "speaker": "B",
